#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:47
msgid "Newlines and comments"
msgstr "换行与注释"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:48
msgid ""
"Group class names the way you think about them, annotate the groups, and "
"let the compiler fold it all into one string."
msgstr "按你思考的方式给类名分组、给每组加注释，剩下的交给编译器折成一个字符串。"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:51
msgid "Static templates compile away"
msgstr "静态模板在编译期处理"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:52
msgid ""
"A static template becomes a string literal. A static macro template has its "
"tailwind-merge resolved at build time too."
msgstr "静态模板会变成字符串字面量；静态的 macro 模板连 tailwind-merge 都在编译期算完。"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:55
msgid "Compiler-only entry"
msgstr "纯编译入口"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:56
msgid ""
"The macro entry contains declarations only. The compiler removes it and "
"imports runtime helpers from twl/runtime."
msgstr "macro 入口只有类型声明。编译器会移除该入口，并从 twl/runtime 导入运行时函数。"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:59
msgid "Every bundler"
msgstr "所有打包器"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:60
msgid ""
"Vite, Rollup, Rolldown, webpack, Rspack, esbuild and Farm through unplugin "
"— and Turbopack through its own loader."
msgstr ""
"Vite、Rollup、Rolldown、webpack、Rspack、esbuild 和 Farm 走 unplugin，Turbopack "
"走它自己的 loader。"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:81
#: src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx:31
msgid ""
"The cn API with macro compilation for commented Tailwind classes and "
"conflict merging."
msgstr "在 cn API 基础上增加 macro 编译，支持 Tailwind 类名注释和冲突合并。"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:93
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "开始使用"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:102
msgid "What you write"
msgstr "你写的"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:103
msgid "What ships"
msgstr "真正发布的"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:138
msgid ""
"This page is built with <TwlRepo>twl</TwlRepo> and "
"<BestI18nRepo>best-i18n</BestI18nRepo>. Every class name on it was folded "
"at build time, and every string above was inlined for this locale."
msgstr ""
"这个页面由 <TwlRepo>twl</TwlRepo> 和 <BestI18nRepo>best-i18n</BestI18nRepo> "
"构建。页面上的每个类名都在编译期折叠完成，上面每句文案也都为当前语言内联好了。"

#: src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx:25
msgid ""
"twl: the cn API, compiled. A commented cn template and the plain string it "
"compiles to."
msgstr "twl：编译期的 cn API。一个带注释的 cn 模板，以及它编译成的纯字符串。"
